{
  "info": {
    "name": "baton-crowdstrike (CrowdStrike Falcon API)",
    "description": "Collection for the real CrowdStrike Falcon user-management API exercised by the baton-crowdstrike connector.\n\nBase URL (regional — set {{baseUrl}} for your tenant's cloud):\n- US-1:  https://api.crowdstrike.com\n- US-2:  https://api.us-2.crowdstrike.com\n- EU-1:  https://api.eu-1.crowdstrike.com\n- US-GOV-1: https://api.laggar.gcw.crowdstrike.com\n\nCredentials:\n1. In the Falcon console go to Support and resources > API clients and keys > Create API client.\n2. Grant these scopes:\n   - User Management: Read  (sync users, roles, grants)\n   - User Management: Write  (provisioning: create/delete users, grant/revoke roles, update profile)\n   - Identity Protection Entities: Read + Identity Protection GraphQL: Write  (only if you also sync security_insight; CrowdStrike requires Write even to read risk scores)\n3. Copy the client_id and client_secret into the environment variables {{clientId}} / {{clientSecret}}. Do NOT commit real secrets.\n\nAuth: run \"Get OAuth Token\" first; it stores the bearer token in {{accessToken}} (CrowdStrike returns HTTP 201 with a token valid ~30 min).\n\nResolve a {{userUuid}} with \"Query User ID by email\" + \"Retrieve User Details\", and a {{roleId}} with \"Query Role IDs\".",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get OAuth Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.access_token);",
                  "pm.test('Token received (201)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.access_token).to.not.be.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/oauth2/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["oauth2", "token"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{clientId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{clientSecret}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /oauth2/token (client_credentials). Returns 201 Created with access_token. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Query User IDs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-management/queries/users/v1?limit=500&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-management", "queries", "users", "v1"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "500" },
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "queryUserV1 — list user UUIDs (offset pagination). Scope: User Management: Read. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#queryuserv1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Query User ID by email (FQL filter)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-management/queries/users/v1?filter=uid:'someone@example.com'&limit=1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-management", "queries", "users", "v1"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "filter", "value": "uid:'someone@example.com'" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "1" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "queryUserV1 with FQL filter on uid — used by findUserByEmail for duplicate resolution during account creation."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Retrieve User Details",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-management/entities/users/GET/v1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-management", "entities", "users", "GET", "v1"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ids\": [\"{{userUuid}}\"]\n}"
            },
            "description": "RetrieveUsersGETV1 — full user details by UUID. Scope: User Management: Read. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#retrieveusersgetv1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-management/entities/users/v1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-management", "entities", "users", "v1"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"uid\": \"newuser@yourdomain.com\",\n  \"first_name\": \"New\",\n  \"last_name\": \"User\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "createUserV1 — uid must be on an allowed domain for the tenant; password omitted triggers an activation email. 409 if the user already exists. Scope: User Management: Write. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#createuserv1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User (first/last name)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-management/entities/users/v1?user_uuid={{userUuid}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-management", "entities", "users", "v1"],
              "query": [{ "key": "user_uuid", "value": "{{userUuid}}" }]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"first_name\": \"Updated\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Name\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "updateUserV1 — partial update of first/last name. 404 if the UUID does not exist. Scope: User Management: Write. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#updateuserv1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-management/entities/users/v1?user_uuid={{userUuid}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-management", "entities", "users", "v1"],
              "query": [{ "key": "user_uuid", "value": "{{userUuid}}" }]
            },
            "description": "deleteUserV1 — permanent delete. 404 if already deleted (connector treats this as success). Scope: User Management: Write. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#deleteuserv1"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Roles",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Query Role IDs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-management/queries/roles/v1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-management", "queries", "roles", "v1"]
            },
            "description": "queriesRolesV1 — list all role IDs. Scope: User Management: Read. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#queriesrolesv1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Role Details by IDs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-management/entities/roles/v1?ids={{roleId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-management", "entities", "roles", "v1"],
              "query": [{ "key": "ids", "value": "{{roleId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "entitiesRolesV1 — role details by ID. Scope: User Management: Read. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#entitiesrolesv1"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "User Roles",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List User Roles (grants)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-management/combined/user-roles/v1?user_uuid={{userUuid}}&limit=500&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-management", "combined", "user-roles", "v1"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "user_uuid", "value": "{{userUuid}}" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "500" },
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "combinedUserRolesV1 — roles granted to a user (used to build grants). Scope: User Management: Read. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#combineduserrolesv1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Grant Role to User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-roles/entities/user-roles/v1?user_uuid={{userUuid}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-roles", "entities", "user-roles", "v1"],
              "query": [{ "key": "user_uuid", "value": "{{userUuid}}" }]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"roleIds\": [\"{{roleId}}\"]\n}"
            },
            "description": "GrantUserRoleIds — assign role(s) to a user. Scope: User Management: Write. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#grantuserroleids"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke Role from User",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user-roles/entities/user-roles/v1?user_uuid={{userUuid}}&ids={{roleId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user-roles", "entities", "user-roles", "v1"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "user_uuid", "value": "{{userUuid}}" },
                { "key": "ids", "value": "{{roleId}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "RevokeUserRoleIds — remove role(s) from a user. Scope: User Management: Write. https://developer.crowdstrike.com/api-reference/collections/user-management/#revokeuserroleids"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://api.us-2.crowdstrike.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "clientId", "value": "<your-client-id>", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "<your-client-secret>", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userUuid", "value": "<user-uuid>", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "roleId", "value": "falcon_console_guest", "type": "string" }
  ]
}
